-converter.gif?t=1750995127\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Programmers are steady, delivering consistent results every week. Artists are more spontaneous, working hard only one week out of the month. Product managers perform best when seated next to other professions. And then there\u2019s the labor law expert\u2014if you keep laying people off, will you \u201clay off\u201d your way to success?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cBoss! I think we should hire people like this for our company\u2026\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811320/extras/subtitle2_2.png?t=1750995127\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811320/extras/image2-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1750995127\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The company\u2019s profits depend not only on your choice of employees, but even more on how you arrange their workstations! Seat data product managers next to programmers, place the chief designer with the artists\u2026 Arrange the workstations well to maximize efficiency!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cBoss, I\u2019ve already arranged a spot for the new hire\u2026\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811320/extras/subtitle3_2.png?t=1750995127\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811320/extras/image3-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1750995127\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by the real-life culture of big tech companies, this game uses jokes and dark humor to poke fun at the workplace practices we all know too well. For example, \u201coptimization\u201d is just a polite way to say layoffs in chinese. Discover hidden Easter eggs and join us in laughing at the absurdities of modern office life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cBoss, the new hires are onboard, workstations are rearranged, and we\u2019ll definitely hit our targets this month! Let\u2019s not talk about \u2018optimization\u2019 just yet!\u201d</i></p>","developers":["Chill Game"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811320/1d30c02ff791396159198838157931955b3d91bf/header.jpg?t=1750995127","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Meow Recruit","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Chill Game"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2026"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811320/d507689a9c9460e916c12b6db957547b836e26b0/ss_d507689a9c9460e916c12b6db957547b836e26b0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1750995127","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3811320/d507689a9c9460e916c12b6db957547b836e26b0/ss_d507689a9c9460e916c12b6db957547b836e26b0.600x338.jpg?t=1750995127"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3