":"Meow Recruit is a casual strategy game where you play as HR in an animal company. Recruit employees, arrange workstations, optimize your team, and build facilities to maximize company's profits. Are you the real HR master?","steam_appid":3811320,"support_info":{"email":"chillgame.pr@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese","type":"game","website":null}